<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Verdana;font-size:10.0pt' lang=3Den-US>-=
 The
**federated credential name** is just an identifier for the federated
credential resource in Azure and can be any unique, descriptive name you
choose.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Verdana;font-size:10.0pt' lang=3Den-US>&=
nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Verdana;font-size:10.0pt' lang=3Den-US>*=
*They do
