<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Verdana;font-size:10.0pt' lang=3Den-US>G=
itHub
Copilot: With `persistentVolumeReclaimPolicy: Retain`, when the PVC is dele=
ted,
the PV enters the `Released` phase but **retains the data** and is **not
automatically available** for new claims. Manual intervention is required to
reuse the PV.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Verdana;font-size:10.0pt' lang=3Den-US>&=
