your custom exception (`FunctionException`) is marked as `[Serializable]` a=
nd
has a public parameterless constructor.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Verdana;font-size:10.0pt' lang=3Den-US>-=
 All
properties on the exception (including inner exceptions) must also be
serializable.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Verdana;font-size:10.0pt' lang=3Den-US>-=
 Avoid
including complex or non-serializable objects as properties on your excepti=
on.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Verdana;font-size:10.0pt' lang=3Den-US>&=
