<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Verdana;font-size:10.0pt' lang=3Den-US>G=
itHub
Copilot: To make Azure Workload Identity work on your pod, you need to have=
 the
**system CA certificates** installed. These are typically provided by the
`ca-certificates` package for your Linux distribution.</p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Verdana;font-size:10.0pt' lang=3Den-US>&=
