style=3D'mso-spacerun:yes'>=C2=A0 </span></p>

<p style=3D'margin:0in;font-family:Verdana;font-size:10.0pt' lang=3Den-US>A=
zure
endpoints (like OIDC and Microsoft APIs) use certificates signed by public
certificate authorities, which are trusted if your pod has the standard CA
bundle.</p>

